  "account": "锦绣千秋录",
  "source_title": "前五名揭晓：栖霞红枫、千年古银杏、海边潮声，压轴的竟是一株一千四百年的银杏，替一座小禅院守住了人心最软的地方。\n#秋日古刹  #千年银杏#大美中国",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 454.508005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "要说中国哪里的秋天，能一边看尽漫山秋色，一边把心安静下来，古刹绝对算得上一个。可您知道中国秋天最震撼心灵的古刹是哪一座吗？上集，咱们聊了寒山寺、悬空寺、灵隐寺、苏州西元寺、悬空寺这一集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名震撼到什么程度。尤其是排在榜首的那座一千四百年来，每到深秋都要落一地黄金。有人说，在他面前站上一会儿，一辈子的疲惫都能放下。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，栖霞寺，江苏南京栖霞山中风西路南京人说，春牛首秋栖霞秋天先指的就是仗。这座寺始建于南齐一千五百多年了，山壁上的千佛岩近三百个佛龛，五百多尊佛像也是从那会儿一凿一凿凿出来的。每年深秋，漫山枫叶一夜烧红，红叶底下是古石窟，红叶后头是皇墙古殿。您走进去，像走进一幅浓得化不开的画。杜牧说，霜叶红于二月花，枫叶就这个脾气，越是挨过霜月红的深，春天的花娇嫩，一场雨就谢了，唯有吃够了风霜的叶子红的罪臣。您说，人到晚年，是不是正该活成这个颜色？第四名潭柘寺，北京门头沟宝珠峰南路北京城有句老话，先有潭柘寺，后有北京城，它立在西山脚下。一千七百多年，毗卢阁前的两株唐代古银杏高三十多米，被历代皇帝封为帝王树。深秋金黄，树冠铺天盖地。金风一过，金色雨幕簌簌落了满院。您踩在松软的金色落叶上，听得风声脑，脑子里过着历史。多少帝王将相当年在这里烧香许愿，那些泼天的富贵繁华，如今全归了这满地尘土，争了一辈子名利，到头来一家老小健健康康，比什么都强。这座寺峨眉山万年寺，四川乐山。这座寺始建于东晋一千六百多年了，供的是普贤菩萨，寺里有座明代的无梁砖殿，不用一根梁，一层层砖砌出穹顶，殿里坐着一尊铜柱的普贤齐象像七米多高，六十多吨重是北宋住的。深秋，您沿着山路往上走，满山彩林云海，在山间翻涌。峨眉石井里的白水。秋风说的就是这普贤菩萨最出名的不是神通，是行愿答应了的事，一辈子做下去，从不叫苦。这像谁？像那些默默操劳了一辈子的母亲，老天爷看得见这份厚重、默默付出的人，终有老天给的心安福报。第二名法与寺浙江舟山、普陀山光熙风下普陀山是观音菩萨的道场。法语寺是山上的第二大寺，面朝大海。他始建于明代四百多年了。市里的九龙殿是清康熙年间，从南京明故宫差来的。店内凿井盘着九条龙，皇宫的气派就这么搬到了海边。可法语是最动人的，不是电，是声音。晨中暮鼓混着海潮声，一浪接一浪从没停过。您站在寺前听潮声涌过来又退下去，心里攒了一年的委屈，也跟着退下去了，女人的心就该向这片海，什么委屈都装得下装着装着就化成了慈悲。您说这是不是最了不起的力量？第一名？终南山古观音禅寺，陕西西安长安区终南山北路脚下。很多人以为第一名不是北京的皇家大厦，就是四大佛教名山。绝想不到，压轴的竟是秦岭终南山脚下，一座极朴素的小小禅院，整座寺庙全部的魂魄全聚在院里那株一千四百年的古银杏树上，像相传是唐太宗李世民亲手栽下的这一千四百年里盛唐的繁华。他见过安史之乱的风烟，他也见过朝代，换了一个又一个皇帝，走了一茬又一茬。当年栽树的人早就成了史书里的几行字，可他还在这站着。每到深秋，秦岭的山风一吹，满树金叶子，簌簌的落一层压一层铺成，一张厚厚软软的黄金地毯，您就站在那树底下，什么也不用说，什么也不用想，一路上受过的委屈，熬过的夜咽下去的话，在一千四百年的静默与金色的暖光里，一下子都被融化了。别的寺争的是殿堂，恢弘，是香火鼎盛，而他只守着一棵树，就守住了人心最软的地方。十座古刹讲完了寒山寺，画了诗意，红螺寺，圆了母爱。灵隐寺解了执念，西园寺暖的烟火，悬空寺立了风骨。栖霞山燃透了风霜，谈柘寺看淡的富贵万年寺抚慰了付出法语四融下了沧海，可只有终南山古观音禅寺，借一数千年的金黄，融化了人间所有的沧桑。您说什么叫震撼心灵？最震撼心灵的不是佛像贴了多少金，不是大殿修了多少帐，而是在这千百年的秋风里，老祖宗给咱们的心灵留了一方避风的港湾。最后问问您，这十座古刹，您去过几座最想去的是哪一座？评论区告诉我，觉得这期让您长了见识，就转给身边跟您一样，爱看人文古迹的人，想听更多古刹里的千年故事。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 2250,
      "text": "要说中国哪里的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2530,
      "end_ms": 4770,
      "text": "能一边看尽漫山秋色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5090,
      "end_ms": 6810,
      "text": "一边把心安静下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6990,
      "end_ms": 9130,
      "text": "古刹绝对算得上一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9770,
      "end_ms": 13990,
      "text": "可您知道中国秋天最震撼心灵的古刹是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14370,
      "end_ms": 14890,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14890,
      "end_ms": 23670,
      "text": "咱们聊了寒山寺、悬空寺、灵隐寺、苏州西元寺、悬空寺这一集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23910,
      "end_ms": 26370,
      "text": "看看前五名震撼到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26850,
      "end_ms": 31720,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座一千四百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 32300,
      "end_ms": 35740,
      "text": "每到深秋都要落一地黄金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 36120,
      "end_ms": 36760,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 37420,
      "end_ms": 39400,
      "text": "在他面前站上一会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 39600,
      "end_ms": 42080,
      "text": "一辈子的疲惫都能放下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42340,
      "end_ms": 43160,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 43520,
      "end_ms": 44720,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 45160,
      "end_ms": 47360,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47680,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49000,
      "end_ms": 49740,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 50160,
      "end_ms": 51000,
      "text": "栖霞寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51720,
      "end_ms": 56520,
      "text": "江苏南京栖霞山中风西路南京人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 57060,
      "end_ms": 61065,
      "text": "春牛首秋栖霞秋天先指的就是仗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61520,
      "end_ms": 65405,
      "text": "这座寺始建于南齐一千五百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 66130,
      "end_ms": 70075,
      "text": "山壁上的千佛岩近三百个佛龛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70730,
      "end_ms": 75405,
      "text": "五百多尊佛像也是从那会儿一凿一凿凿出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 75860,
      "end_ms": 76885,
      "text": "每年深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 77440,
      "end_ms": 79765,
      "text": "漫山枫叶一夜烧红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 80420,
      "end_ms": 82315,
      "text": "红叶底下是古石窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 82830,
      "end_ms": 85095,
      "text": "红叶后头是皇墙古殿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 85600,
      "end_ms": 86675,
      "text": "您走进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 87120,
      "end_ms": 90025,
      "text": "像走进一幅浓得化不开的画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 90560,
      "end_ms": 91240,
      "text": "杜牧说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 91640,
      "end_ms": 93635,
      "text": "霜叶红于二月花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94100,
      "end_ms": 95655,
      "text": "枫叶就这个脾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 96550,
      "end_ms": 99905,
      "text": "越是挨过霜月红的深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 100700,
      "end_ms": 102575,
      "text": "春天的花娇嫩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 103080,
      "end_ms": 104775,
      "text": "一场雨就谢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 105320,
      "end_ms": 109185,
      "text": "唯有吃够了风霜的叶子红的罪臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109800,
      "end_ms": 110260,
      "text": "您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 110600,
      "end_ms": 111620,
      "text": "人到晚年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 112100,
      "end_ms": 114335,
      "text": "是不是正该活成这个颜色？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 114700,
      "end_ms": 116565,
      "text": "第四名潭柘寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117050,
      "end_ms": 121400,
      "text": "北京门头沟宝珠峰南路北京城有句老话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122060,
      "end_ms": 123320,
      "text": "先有潭柘寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 123560,
      "end_ms": 124640,
      "text": "后有北京城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 125280,
      "end_ms": 126860,
      "text": "它立在西山脚下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 127100,
      "end_ms": 128340,
      "text": "一千七百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 128740,
      "end_ms": 133320,
      "text": "毗卢阁前的两株唐代古银杏高三十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 133680,
      "end_ms": 136180,
      "text": "被历代皇帝封为帝王树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 136800,
      "end_ms": 137920,
      "text": "深秋金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138000,
      "end_ms": 139540,
      "text": "树冠铺天盖地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 139980,
      "end_ms": 140980,
      "text": "金风一过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 141380,
      "end_ms": 144260,
      "text": "金色雨幕簌簌落了满院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 144700,
      "end_ms": 147500,
      "text": "您踩在松软的金色落叶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00054",
      "start_ms": 147980,
      "end_ms": 149795,
      "text": "听得风声脑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00055",
      "start_ms": 149990,
      "end_ms": 151110,
      "text": "脑子里过着历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00056",
      "start_ms": 151650,
      "end_ms": 155850,
      "text": "多少帝王将相当年在这里烧香许愿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156550,
      "end_ms": 158650,
      "text": "那些泼天的富贵繁华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00058",
      "start_ms": 159290,
      "end_ms": 161710,
      "text": "如今全归了这满地尘土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00059",
      "start_ms": 162070,
      "end_ms": 163570,
      "text": "争了一辈子名利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00060",
      "start_ms": 163950,
      "end_ms": 166370,
      "text": "到头来一家老小健健康康，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00061",
      "start_ms": 166790,
      "end_ms": 167750,
      "text": "比什么都强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00062",
      "start_ms": 168170,
      "end_ms": 170570,
      "text": "这座寺峨眉山万年寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00063",
      "start_ms": 170930,
      "end_ms": 171770,
      "text": "四川乐山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00064",
      "start_ms": 172570,
      "end_ms": 176130,
      "text": "这座寺始建于东晋一千六百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00065",
      "start_ms": 176590,
      "end_ms": 178230,
      "text": "供的是普贤菩萨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00066",
      "start_ms": 178690,
      "end_ms": 181300,
      "text": "寺里有座明代的无梁砖殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00067",
      "start_ms": 181960,
      "end_ms": 182920,
      "text": "不用一根梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183280,
      "end_ms": 185620,
      "text": "一层层砖砌出穹顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00069",
      "start_ms": 186280,
      "end_ms": 191180,
      "text": "殿里坐着一尊铜柱的普贤齐象像七米多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00070",
      "start_ms": 191480,
      "end_ms": 194220,
      "text": "六十多吨重是北宋住的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00071",
      "start_ms": 194600,
      "end_ms": 195180,
      "text": "深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00072",
      "start_ms": 195760,
      "end_ms": 197760,
      "text": "您沿着山路往上走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00073",
      "start_ms": 198300,
      "end_ms": 200760,
      "text": "满山彩林云海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00074",
      "start_ms": 200820,
      "end_ms": 202020,
      "text": "在山间翻涌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00075",
      "start_ms": 202640,
      "end_ms": 204460,
      "text": "峨眉石井里的白水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00076",
      "start_ms": 204480,
      "end_ms": 209825,
      "text": "秋风说的就是这普贤菩萨最出名的不是神通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00077",
      "start_ms": 210590,
      "end_ms": 213110,
      "text": "是行愿答应了的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00078",
      "start_ms": 213350,
      "end_ms": 214790,
      "text": "一辈子做下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00079",
      "start_ms": 215150,
      "end_ms": 216110,
      "text": "从不叫苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216530,
      "end_ms": 217130,
      "text": "这像谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00081",
      "start_ms": 217870,
      "end_ms": 220890,
      "text": "像那些默默操劳了一辈子的母亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00082",
      "start_ms": 221290,
      "end_ms": 225510,
      "text": "老天爷看得见这份厚重、默默付出的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00083",
      "start_ms": 225990,
      "end_ms": 228370,
      "text": "终有老天给的心安福报。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00084",
      "start_ms": 228670,
      "end_ms": 237050,
      "text": "第二名法与寺浙江舟山、普陀山光熙风下普陀山是观音菩萨的道场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00085",
      "start_ms": 237550,
      "end_ms": 239895,
      "text": "法语寺是山上的第二大寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00086",
      "start_ms": 240520,
      "end_ms": 241445,
      "text": "面朝大海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00087",
      "start_ms": 241910,
      "end_ms": 245015,
      "text": "他始建于明代四百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00088",
      "start_ms": 245530,
      "end_ms": 248780,
      "text": "市里的九龙殿是清康熙年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00089",
      "start_ms": 248800,
      "end_ms": 250865,
      "text": "从南京明故宫差来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00090",
      "start_ms": 251410,
      "end_ms": 253945,
      "text": "店内凿井盘着九条龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254560,
      "end_ms": 257675,
      "text": "皇宫的气派就这么搬到了海边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00092",
      "start_ms": 258080,
      "end_ms": 260125,
      "text": "可法语是最动人的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00093",
      "start_ms": 260420,
      "end_ms": 261215,
      "text": "不是电，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00094",
      "start_ms": 261550,
      "end_ms": 262255,
      "text": "是声音。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00095",
      "start_ms": 262970,
      "end_ms": 266305,
      "text": "晨中暮鼓混着海潮声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00096",
      "start_ms": 267170,
      "end_ms": 269845,
      "text": "一浪接一浪从没停过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00097",
      "start_ms": 270260,
      "end_ms": 275595,
      "text": "您站在寺前听潮声涌过来又退下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00098",
      "start_ms": 276160,
      "end_ms": 278140,
      "text": "心里攒了一年的委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00099",
      "start_ms": 278500,
      "end_ms": 280095,
      "text": "也跟着退下去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00100",
      "start_ms": 280690,
      "end_ms": 283415,
      "text": "女人的心就该向这片海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00101",
      "start_ms": 283930,
      "end_ms": 288355,
      "text": "什么委屈都装得下装着装着就化成了慈悲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00102",
      "start_ms": 288820,
      "end_ms": 291445,
      "text": "您说这是不是最了不起的力量？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291860,
      "end_ms": 292315,
      "text": "第一名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00104",
      "start_ms": 293050,
      "end_ms": 295510,
      "text": "终南山古观音禅寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00105",
      "start_ms": 296030,
      "end_ms": 299950,
      "text": "陕西西安长安区终南山北路脚下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00106",
      "start_ms": 300390,
      "end_ms": 303410,
      "text": "很多人以为第一名不是北京的皇家大厦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00107",
      "start_ms": 303810,
      "end_ms": 305450,
      "text": "就是四大佛教名山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00108",
      "start_ms": 306050,
      "end_ms": 307010,
      "text": "绝想不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00109",
      "start_ms": 307110,
      "end_ms": 310550,
      "text": "压轴的竟是秦岭终南山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00110",
      "start_ms": 310550,
      "end_ms": 313350,
      "text": "一座极朴素的小小禅院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00111",
      "start_ms": 313850,
      "end_ms": 321510,
      "text": "整座寺庙全部的魂魄全聚在院里那株一千四百年的古银杏树上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00112",
      "start_ms": 321510,
      "end_ms": 329660,
      "text": "像相传是唐太宗李世民亲手栽下的这一千四百年里盛唐的繁华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00113",
      "start_ms": 329660,
      "end_ms": 332580,
      "text": "他见过安史之乱的风烟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00114",
      "start_ms": 332600,
      "end_ms": 334740,
      "text": "他也见过朝代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00115",
      "start_ms": 334800,
      "end_ms": 337260,
      "text": "换了一个又一个皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00116",
      "start_ms": 337340,
      "end_ms": 338800,
      "text": "走了一茬又一茬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00117",
      "start_ms": 339460,
      "end_ms": 343660,
      "text": "当年栽树的人早就成了史书里的几行字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00118",
      "start_ms": 344140,
      "end_ms": 345320,
      "text": "可他还在这站着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00119",
      "start_ms": 346040,
      "end_ms": 346940,
      "text": "每到深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00120",
      "start_ms": 347800,
      "end_ms": 349400,
      "text": "秦岭的山风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00121",
      "start_ms": 350240,
      "end_ms": 351560,
      "text": "满树金叶子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00122",
      "start_ms": 351700,
      "end_ms": 355350,
      "text": "簌簌的落一层压一层铺成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00123",
      "start_ms": 355370,
      "end_ms": 358255,
      "text": "一张厚厚软软的黄金地毯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00124",
      "start_ms": 358700,
      "end_ms": 360575,
      "text": "您就站在那树底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00125",
      "start_ms": 361240,
      "end_ms": 362420,
      "text": "什么也不用说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00126",
      "start_ms": 362820,
      "end_ms": 364115,
      "text": "什么也不用想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00127",
      "start_ms": 364490,
      "end_ms": 366275,
      "text": "一路上受过的委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00128",
      "start_ms": 366600,
      "end_ms": 368845,
      "text": "熬过的夜咽下去的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00129",
      "start_ms": 369280,
      "end_ms": 372945,
      "text": "在一千四百年的静默与金色的暖光里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00130",
      "start_ms": 373210,
      "end_ms": 374895,
      "text": "一下子都被融化了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00131",
      "start_ms": 375290,
      "end_ms": 377190,
      "text": "别的寺争的是殿堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00132",
      "start_ms": 377250,
      "end_ms": 377765,
      "text": "恢弘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00133",
      "start_ms": 378330,
      "end_ms": 379775,
      "text": "是香火鼎盛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00134",
      "start_ms": 380340,
      "end_ms": 382185,
      "text": "而他只守着一棵树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00135",
      "start_ms": 382630,
      "end_ms": 385245,
      "text": "就守住了人心最软的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00136",
      "start_ms": 385680,
      "end_ms": 388390,
      "text": "十座古刹讲完了寒山寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00137",
      "start_ms": 388550,
      "end_ms": 389665,
      "text": "画了诗意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00138",
      "start_ms": 390180,
      "end_ms": 391080,
      "text": "红螺寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00139",
      "start_ms": 391200,
      "end_ms": 392145,
      "text": "圆了母爱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00140",
      "start_ms": 392660,
      "end_ms": 394475,
      "text": "灵隐寺解了执念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00141",
      "start_ms": 394950,
      "end_ms": 396955,
      "text": "西园寺暖的烟火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00142",
      "start_ms": 397350,
      "end_ms": 399215,
      "text": "悬空寺立了风骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00143",
      "start_ms": 399610,
      "end_ms": 401735,
      "text": "栖霞山燃透了风霜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00144",
      "start_ms": 402200,
      "end_ms": 409125,
      "text": "谈柘寺看淡的富贵万年寺抚慰了付出法语四融下了沧海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00145",
      "start_ms": 409900,
      "end_ms": 412685,
      "text": "可只有终南山古观音禅寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00146",
      "start_ms": 413220,
      "end_ms": 415295,
      "text": "借一数千年的金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00147",
      "start_ms": 415960,
      "end_ms": 418345,
      "text": "融化了人间所有的沧桑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00148",
      "start_ms": 418750,
      "end_ms": 420715,
      "text": "您说什么叫震撼心灵？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00149",
      "start_ms": 421130,
      "end_ms": 424415,
      "text": "最震撼心灵的不是佛像贴了多少金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00150",
      "start_ms": 424930,
      "end_ms": 426785,
      "text": "不是大殿修了多少帐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00151",
      "start_ms": 427260,
      "end_ms": 429385,
      "text": "而是在这千百年的秋风里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00152",
      "start_ms": 429840,
      "end_ms": 433505,
      "text": "老祖宗给咱们的心灵留了一方避风的港湾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00153",
      "start_ms": 433940,
      "end_ms": 435035,
      "text": "最后问问您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00154",
      "start_ms": 435600,
      "end_ms": 436640,
      "text": "这十座古刹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00155",
      "start_ms": 436640,
      "end_ms": 440225,
      "text": "您去过几座最想去的是哪一座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00156",
      "start_ms": 440690,
      "end_ms": 441905,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00157",
      "start_ms": 442540,
      "end_ms": 444525,
      "text": "觉得这期让您长了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00158",
      "start_ms": 445090,
      "end_ms": 447170,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00159",
      "start_ms": 447170,
      "end_ms": 448795,
      "text": "爱看人文古迹的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00160",
      "start_ms": 449260,
      "end_ms": 451615,
      "text": "想听更多古刹里的千年故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00161",
      "start_ms": 451930,
      "end_ms": 452550,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_794a2b8ce8d2ca0b_s00162",
      "start_ms": 452790,
      "end_ms": 454185,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
